### AX SAP B1 API - Timesheet Management

### 1. Ottieni tutti i timesheet (ODBC SAP HANA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/timesheet
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Ottieni un timesheet specifico (ODBC SAP HANA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/timesheet/123
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Ottieni timesheet per dipendente (ODBC SAP HANA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/timesheet/employee/EMP001
Accept: application/json

###

### 3.1. Ottieni timesheet per dipendente in intervallo di date (ODBC SAP HANA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/timesheet/employee/EMP001/daterange?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Ottieni timesheet per progetto (ODBC SAP HANA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/timesheet/project/PRJ001
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Ottieni timesheet per intervallo di date (ODBC SAP HANA)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/timesheet/daterange?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Crea un nuovo timesheet (SAP B1 Service Layer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/timesheet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2024-01-15T00:00:00",
  "employeeId": "EMP001",
  "projectId": "PRJ001",
  "activityId": "ACT001",
  "hours": 8.5,
  "description": "Sviluppo funzionalità API",
  "resId": "EMP001",
  "cardCode": "C001",
  "cardName": "Azienda Test",
  "refId": "REF001",
  "refData": "Dati referente",
  "project": "PRJ001",
  "projectName": "Progetto Test",
  "subProject": "SUB001",
  "activity": "ACT001",
  "subActivity": "SUBACT001",
  "activityName": "Attività Test",
  "timeStart": "09:00:00",
  "timeEnd": "17:30:00",
  "timePa": "01:00:00",
  "timeNF": "00:30:00",
  "timeNrPa": 8.5,
  "timeNrNF": 0.5,
  "timeNrTot": 9.0,
  "timeNrNet": 8.0,
  "price": 50.00,
  "lineTotal": 400.00,
  "descExt": "Descrizione esterna",
  "descInt": "Descrizione interna",
  "itemCode": "ITEM001",
  "status": "Draft",
  "approver": "APP001"
}

###

### 7. Aggiorna un timesheet esistente (SAP B1 Service Layer)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/timesheet/123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "docEntry": 123,
  "date": "2024-01-15T00:00:00",
  "employeeId": "EMP001",
  "projectId": "PRJ001",
  "activityId": "ACT001",
  "hours": 9.0,
  "description": "Sviluppo funzionalità API - Aggiornato",
  "resId": "EMP001",
  "cardCode": "C001",
  "cardName": "Azienda Test",
  "refId": "REF001",
  "refData": "Dati referente aggiornati",
  "project": "PRJ001",
  "projectName": "Progetto Test",
  "subProject": "SUB001",
  "activity": "ACT001",
  "subActivity": "SUBACT001",
  "activityName": "Attività Test",
  "timeStart": "09:00:00",
  "timeEnd": "18:00:00",
  "timePa": "01:00:00",
  "timeNF": "00:00:00",
  "timeNrPa": 9.0,
  "timeNrNF": 0.0,
  "timeNrTot": 9.0,
  "timeNrNet": 9.0,
  "price": 50.00,
  "lineTotal": 450.00,
  "descExt": "Descrizione esterna aggiornata",
  "descInt": "Descrizione interna aggiornata",
  "itemCode": "ITEM001",
  "status": "Approved",
  "approver": "APP001"
}

###

### 8. Elimina un timesheet (SAP B1 Service Layer)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/timesheet/123

###

### ── Fatturazione dal portale AX.360 (istanza di test: header X-Api-Key di test) ──

### 9. Articoli di vendita attivi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lookup/items?sellableOnly=true
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 10. Anteprima del documento (nessuna scrittura in SAP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales-documents/preview
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "correlationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "portalNumber": "FT-TEST-0001",
  "documentKind": "invoice",
  "posting": "draft",
  "cardCode": "IT00387",
  "docDate": "2026-09-30",
  "comments": "Attività svolte dal 01-09-2026 al 30-09-2026",
  "projectCode": "25PRJ_2500040",
  "customerReference": { "orderNumber": "AD250169", "orderDate": "2026-08-01", "cig": null, "cup": null },
  "lines": [
    { "itemCode": "ATT_MTF_CONSULENZA", "description": "Consulenza funzionale – E. Pasquariello – dal 01/09/2026 al 26/09/2026",
      "quantity": 4.25, "unitPrice": 75.0, "unitOfMeasureCode": "HH", "projectCode": "25PRJ_2500040",
      "costingCode2": "PAS", "costingCode3": "CONS" }
  ]
}

###

### 11. Bozza di fattura (ripeterla: 200 con alreadyExisted = true, nessun doppione)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sales-documents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "correlationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "portalNumber": "FT-TEST-0001",
  "documentKind": "invoice",
  "posting": "draft",
  "cardCode": "IT00387",
  "docDate": "2026-09-30",
  "comments": "Attività svolte dal 01-09-2026 al 30-09-2026",
  "projectCode": "25PRJ_2500040",
  "lines": [
    { "itemCode": "ATT_MTF_CONSULENZA", "description": "Consulenza funzionale – E. Pasquariello – dal 01/09/2026 al 26/09/2026",
      "quantity": 4.25, "unitPrice": 75.0, "unitOfMeasureCode": "HH", "projectCode": "25PRJ_2500040",
      "costingCode2": "PAS", "costingCode3": "CONS" }
  ]
}

###

### 12. Ordini cliente correlati al portale
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales-orders?since=2026-09-01
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 13. Nuovo progetto contabile (codice dal pattern SapB1:FiscalProjectCodePattern)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/fiscal-projects
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{ "name": "Progetto di collaudo fatturazione", "validFrom": "2026-10-01", "validTo": null, "code": null }

###

### Variabili di ambiente
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@apiKey = CHANGE_ME_TEST_API_KEY
